OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters spend third night at
OL,4,Ascene of Glasgow scrapyard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo casualties were reported and one
OL,7,Fappliance remained in attendance
OL,8,Fdampening down hotspots on Monday
OL,9,Fmorning.
